# Testing

- Do not bypass tests or skip CI checks without documenting why.
- Add/update pytest tests for backend behavior changes.
- Run `ai-evals/regression` when changing prompts, models, or AI services.
- Add Playwright coverage for new critical user journeys.
- Use mocks for Gemini in unit tests; avoid live API calls in default CI.
- Do not use production data in automated tests.
